 "note": "High school identified from the printed title 'HIGH SCHOOL FACULTY / STAFF ROSTER' (line 1) and principal Michael Barney. Two columns, each 'name  role'; every cell placed by its Textract x-position (left names ~0.14, right names ~0.53), which settles the single-name rows. grade_or_dept is the department heading above the person in their own column; rows 2-4 sit above any heading and carry none. Lines 12 (Michael Esposito), 27 (Nathan Diperri) and 34 (Katie Hebert) are right-column only; lines 31, 39, 47 left only. Peter McCauliff (Athletic Director), Darlene Steele (Athletic Secretary) and Pamela Vallee (Media Specialist), lines 28-30, follow the Unified Arts list in the right column with no department heading of their own, so grade_or_dept is left empty rather than inherited. Lines 20-21, 28, 32, 35, 40 and 48 hold a heading in one column and a person in the other and are entry lines. Line 52 is the page number."
